 <var class=\"keyword varname\">longchar</var>\n          </dt>\n          <dd class=\"dd pd\">The name of a LONGCHAR variable. </dd>\n        \n      </dl>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"IS-CODEPAGE-FIXED-function__see-also_GC18RZ2695495\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d227183e140\">See also</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">\n        <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"FIX-CODEPAGE-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/FIX-CODEPAGE-statement.html\">FIX-CODEPAGE statement</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"GET-CODEPAGE-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/GET-CODEPAGE-function.html\">GET-CODEPAGE function</a></p>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n<nav role=\"navigation\"><div class=\"familylinks\"><div class=\"previouslink\"><strong>Previous topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"IS-ATTR-SPACE-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/IS-ATTR-SPACE-function.html\">IS-ATTR-SPACE function</a></div><div class=\"nextlink\"><strong>Next topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"IS-COLUMN-CODEPAGE-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/IS-COLUMN-CODEPAGE-function.html\">IS-COLUMN-CODEPAGE function</a></div></div></nav><nav class=\"related-links\" role=\"navigation\"></nav></article></main></article>\n","isWatched":false,"labelText":"Product; Product > OpenEdge; Product > OpenEdge > Version 11.7; Format; Format > Documentation","likes":0,"likeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/like/309877","myDocsURL":null,"numOfPageViews":0,"numOfRatingsText":"<span>0 Ratings","revised":2879,"showWatch":false,"topicMeta":[["bookowner","oe11docs"],["bookrights","oe11